('library','A library announcement',"The library will be closed on Monday while the heating system is repaired. All books due back on that day can be returned on Tuesday without a fine. The online catalogue will still be available. Our reading group, normally held on Monday evening, will meet on Wednesday this week. The children's storytelling session on Saturday is unchanged.",[('When can Monday books be returned without a fine?',['Tuesday','Wednesday','Saturday'],0,'Books due on Monday can be returned on Tuesday.'),('Which event has changed day?',['Children’s storytelling','The reading group','A book sale'],1,'The reading group moves from Monday to Wednesday.')]),
('course','Taking a course',"My friend persuaded me to try an evening cooking course. I had expected the teacher to show us difficult recipes, but she began with simple dishes. That made me feel more confident. We worked in pairs and shared the ingredients. The course lasted six weeks. I now cook for my family on Sundays, although I still ask for help with desserts.",[('Why did the speaker feel more confident?',['The class was cancelled','They started with simple dishes','Their friend cooked everything'],1,'Beginning with simple dishes increased confidence.'),('How long was the course?',['Four weeks','Six weeks','Eight weeks'],1,'The course lasted six weeks.')]),
